<title>USA: Purus Inc sets $3/shr cash dividend.</title>
<headline>Purus Inc sets $3/shr cash dividend.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Purus Inc said Tuesday its board of directors declared a special cash dividend of $3.00 per share.</p>
<p>The dividend will be paid December 2 to shareholders of record as of November 1, the company said.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk  (212) 859-1610</p>
</text>
